# AUTH AND REGISTRY SETTINGS ONLY. pnpm 12 reads nothing else from this file — every other setting lives in
# pnpm-workspace.yaml, and one left here is not rejected, just silently ignored. `save-prefix=` sat here and
# did nothing: `pnpm add` wrote `^1.2.3` against a repo whose every pin is exact. It is `savePrefix` in
# pnpm-workspace.yaml now.
@jsr:registry=https://npm.jsr.io
